DOAO6SJc7lCl6U","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T17:29:39Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T09:02:03Z","body":"I'd say this isn't a bug, the checkbox controls if the property is enabled or not, I think it's supposed to work like this:\n* The first checkbox is unchecked, no loop, regardless of the second (which might or might not be import based)\n* The first checkbox is checked and the second is unchecked, no loop\n* The first checkbox is checked and the second is checked, loop","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3842662036/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3845803642","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115825#issuecomment-3845803642","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115825","id":3845803642,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lOk56","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T07:28:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T07:28:06Z","body":"I just tested how each checkbox works and I think it's more of a documentation issue rather than a bug.\nThis parameter doesn't show up for `AudioStream`s that don't have a looping import property (for example, `AudioStreamWAV`), it only shows up for `AudioStream`s that can have looping (for example, `AudioStreamMP3` and `AudioStreamOggVorbis`).\nIf the first checkbox is checked in the `AudioStreamPlayer` it overwrites the import parameter:\n- If looping wasn't enabled in the `AudioStream` and both checkboxes are checked, the audio loops\n- If looping was enabled in the `AudioStream` and only the first checkbox is checked, the audio doesn't loop\n\nIf the first checkbox is not checked, the overwrite doesn't happen and the audio loops if looping was enabled in the import settings.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3845803642/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]